{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7fff68a9-3972-8cea-a4cd-24126a52b0ec",
  "created_at": "2026-02-19T11:00:57-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Celeste Gomes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. My name is Celeste Gomes. I am calling about a short-term rental license, and I am afraid I do not quite understand how the renewal is supposed to work. Kindly bear with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, take your time. Is this a license you already hold, or are you applying for the first time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:58:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I already hold one. I believe it was issued last spring, though I could not tell you the exact date. Is it renewed every year, or every two years? The paper I have is rather unclear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:59:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the property address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:59:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "360 Pelham Street, on the Hill. It is the upstairs unit that I rent out to visitors."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:59:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Licenses like that are generally renewed on a cycle, and the date should be printed on the license itself. Do you see an expiration anywhere on your copy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a date at the top, but I thought that was the date it was printed. Is that not the same thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not necessarily. The issue date and the expiration are usually two different lines. I can look your address up while we talk, if you like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:59:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, kindly do that. And I should also ask about the inspection. Someone told me there is one, but I do not know whether it happens every time or only the first time. What does the inspector actually look at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:59:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally they're checking basic safety things, like smoke and carbon monoxide detectors, exits, that the unit is as described. Whether it's every renewal I'll want to confirm with the inspector's office, so I'll put that on the note for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T10:59:57-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Do they need the unit to be in perfect order? I am rearranging the furniture at the moment. I have moved the couch twice already, and I am not certain where it ought to finally go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:00:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, furniture placement isn't the concern. Just keep walkways and exits clear so nothing's blocking a door or a window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:00:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that is a relief. Then I shall leave it by the wall for now. And the fee, if you would kindly tell me. Is it the same amount as last time, or does it change?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:00:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the current fee in front of me, and I'd rather you get the right number. Let me have the licensing staff call you back with the fee, the renewal date, and the inspection details. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is 401-555-0159. Would they call today, do you think? I confess I am still a little unsure which of these dates is the one that matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll mark it for today or tomorrow, and they'll go over the dates with you line by line. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-19T11:00:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you kindly, Anita."
    }
  ],
